  "summary": [
    "Inputs, outputs, and execution boundary of a build; the build never rewrites index target documents",
    "Target resolution: argument combination rules, directory and pattern expansion, exclusion matching, path normalization, symlinks",
    "ID check: reading doc_link_id, excluding documents with missing or duplicate IDs and reporting them",
    "DLID assignment operation: explicit start, duplicate origin confirmation, section ID issuance, 60-bit Crockford Base32 IDs, rollback on non-DLID diffs",
    "Change set: new, departed, moved, content-hash changed, reference changed; section-level add, delete, move, heading and body change",
    "Move detection records kept per ToC identification key by the script and aggregated for the completion result",
    "Update plan and candidate validation; AI generation only when the search backend is ToC, doc-db sync after confirmation",
    "Completion output: counts on stdout, full details in a detail file under .temp/doc-link/index-docs",
    "Atomic writes via os.replace for document info and the confirmed ToC, no locking",
    "Failure handling and rerun convergence without notification state"
  ],
